WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.730
I activate Rank Domination's effect!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.770
Hope Ray Victory loses 7000 Attack Points!

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.940
N-No way! Its Attack Power became zero!

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.910
Go! Etheric Maahes!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.120
Attack Victory!

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.790
Astral...!

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.040
That's it!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:31.300
I activate the effect of Rainbow Kuriboh in my hand!

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.380
I can equip this card to an opponent Xyz Monster when it attacks!

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.390
The equipped monster can't attack!

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:45.100
I equip Rainbow Kuriboh to Etheric Maahes!

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.400
So you choose to delay your demise.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.190
Since the battle's over...

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:54.070
Hope Ray Victory's Attack Power returns to normal!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.620
I set one card face-down and end my turn.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.160
And now, the Monsters Special Summoned by Etheric Maahes' effect...

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.500
...return to being Overlay Units.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.000
<i>Though I hate to admit it, he's right...</i>

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.340
<i>As things are now...</i>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:15.880
<i>Astral...</i>

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.200
Here.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.070
Huh?

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.240
You need to eat.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.660
What's your name?

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.370
Iris.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:50.670
Rio...

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:53.740
Were you the one who drew me to this girl?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.880
Or...

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.720
Are you...?

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:11.980
<i>Whatever the case...</i>

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.440
<i>I...</i>

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.400
GO!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.870
Vector!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.040
Nasch...!

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:40.260
Vector has assembled his army just over this valley.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.330
It is now we must mount the final battle against him!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:47.560
Our great King, we shall abide by any decision you make!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.770
We place our lives in your hands, our King.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.060
The same goes for me!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:52.940
Me as well!

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.170
I understand.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.970
Wait for my signal before launching an all-out attack.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:58.990
Sir!

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:03.910
Are you doubting yourself?

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.870
Vector must be defeated at all costs.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.580
But if we fight him now,

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.210
there will certainly be countless sacrifices on our side.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.500
Please leave me...

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:24.260
<i>By fighting, my comrades will...</i>

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.930
<i>No, the entire world will get dragged into our fight and suffer great injury.</i>

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.930
<i>I...</i>

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:32.340
<i>Ryouga.</i>

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.070
<i>Rio...</i>

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.110
This is our other past, Ryouga.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.070
I know...

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:49.080
<i>In this world, I have become a guardian spirit protecting my dear brother.</i>

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:52.180
<i>Yes... I've been watching this entire time along with you.</i>

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.330
<i>Your life, I mean, dear brother.</i>

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.790
<i>That is why I know.</i>

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.300
<i>I know when you are in doubt.</i>

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.160
Rio...

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.840
What am I supposed to do?

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.840
<i>Even when making decisions, you're always so kind...</i>

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.460
<i>But you're always suffering.</i>

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.890
Hatred gives birth to more hatred.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:15.270
There's a guy who taught me that.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:18.820
<i>You mean Yuma, right?</i>

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:21.650
But...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.530
What's happening here is definitely part of my memories!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.990
Durbe's right. We've lived two different lives.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:32.250
<i>It just means you're a special chosen person, dear brother.</i>

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:37.420
<i>You're someone who will 
determine the fate of this world, dear brother.</i>

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.380
<i>And you're staring right into that destiny right now.</i>

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.090
<i>I am always here by your side, dear brother.</i>

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:48.010
<i>But Rio...</i>

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:49.700
<i>If this is my destiny,</i>

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:54.600
<i>I'll...fight against it in my own way.</i>

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:04.070
Here I come, Vector!

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.280
What?! You can't find Nasch anywhere?!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.710
Sir! We can't find the king anywhere!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.890
Don't tell me he went to challenge Vector alone...!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.600
That's...!

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:43.330
The labyrinth where I fought against Abyss!

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:51.160
To think the two of us had such a history...!

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:56.410
Vector! There's no reason to drag 
so many innocent people into this fight!

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.250
The two of us are going to have a decisive match to settle this!

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.080
Sounds like fun!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:05.410
I guess I'll accept your little challenge!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.450
<i>Welcome</i>, Nasch!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.410
Vector...

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:40.120
I can't believe you'd show up here <i>all by yourself</i>!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.750
You lousy...!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:45.300
Now then, since you gave me <i>your</i> proposal,

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.920
it's only fair that <i>I</i> decide the method of our showdown!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:49.770
What?!

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.760
Our match will be a Dark Game with Duel Monsters!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:35.700
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.750
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:46.210
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:49.760
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:54.640
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:07:54.640 --> 00:08:00.980
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:04.190
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:07.070
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:11.700
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.780
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:23.250
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.740
Duel Monsters?

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.790
I see... So these stone slates are the cards, right?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:48.210
"Clash of the Two Kings! An Ancient Duel - Shark vs. Vector"

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.210
I'll make you regret challenging me to a Duel!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:49.710
Here I come!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:51.340
Duel!!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:56.840
The first turn's mine! My turn! Draw!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.470
I Summon Gorgonic Ghoul!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.520
I then Special Summon another Gorgonic Ghoul!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:13.190
When I have a Gorgonic Ghoul on the field,

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.820
this Monster can be Special Summoned by paying 300 of my Life!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.950
I'll Special Summon a third Gorgonic Ghoul!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:26.580
Then I activate a Magic! Molting Away from the Status Quo!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:30.290
When I have three Monsters of the same level in play,

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:36.590
I can look at my opponent's deck and Special Summon a Monster of the same level!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.090
From my deck?!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.220
And the one I choose is...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.600
This one!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.020
I Special Summon Mermaid Shark onto my field!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.490
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:03.540
I set two stone slabs and end my turn!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.580
You may think you gathered a ton of Monsters instantly,

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.630
but I'm gonna wipe them all out in one blow!

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.170
My turn! Draw!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.670
I Summon Spear Shark!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:23.140
Then I Special Summon Silent Angler!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:29.190
Silent Angler can be Special Summoned when I control a Water-Attribute Monster on my field!

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.650
And then I Special Summon a third Silent Angler!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.480
Go! Spear Shark!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.030
You fell for it!

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:44.240
I activate the Continuous Trap, Gorgonic Temptation!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:47.040
When I have a Gorgonic Monster in play,

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.750
I can change the opponent's battle target once per turn!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.710
I'll change the attack target to Mermaid Shark!

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.920
There's not even a point to using that Trap!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.090
Spear Shark has the higher Attack Points!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:06.560
You just <i>don't get</i> what a Duel of Darkness means, do you?!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.770
What?!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.890
Why don't you take a look at <i>this</i>?!

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.450
We shall save the king! All troops, advance!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.790
This can't be! An all-out war has begun?!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.210
I thought I told you before!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.630
That this was a <i>Dark Game</i>, I mean!

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.340
Right now the two of us are <i>Gods</i>!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.720
And this Duel will decide <i>their</i> fate!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.760
And the one who pulled the trigger was <i>you</i>!

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.810
But the pain I feel...

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.610
...comes nowhere close to the pain you feel in your heart!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.360
You bastard!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:04.160
Why are you dragging other innocent people into our fight?!

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.570
Ain't that obvious?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.290
Because that's your <i>weakness</i>, of course!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:13.290
All that kindness and justice dwelling inside your heart, I mean!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:18.000
I want nothing more than to see you <i>bowing your head</i> as you <i>writhe in agony</i>!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.800
Vector!!

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:28.310
My Trap activates at this moment! Conspiratorial Catastrophe!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.480
Since the Monster I stole from you battled,

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.150
and because I took more than 1000 points of damage,

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:42.990
all stone slabs you control with Attack Power higher than the destroyed Monster will be destroyed!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:44.530
What?!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.290
All the...Monsters in my deck...?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:01.880
It's a dead end!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.520
I set one stone slab face-down! Turn end!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.940
Now's where the <i>real show</i> begins!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.230
My turn! Draw!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.740
I Summon Gorgonic Cerberus!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.450
Then I activate Gorgonic Cerberus' effect!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.830
When Gorgonic Cerberus is successfully Summoned,

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:34.000
it raises the level of all other Monsters I control to three!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:38.750
I Overlay the Level Three Gorgonic Cerberus and Ghoul!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:44.510
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.300
Xyz Summon!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.970
Show yourself, Gorgonic Guardian!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:56.560
I'll then Overlay the remaining two Gorgonic Ghouls!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.190
Xyz Summon!

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:03.150
Show yourself, my second Gorgonic Guardian!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.150
We'll take our time tormenting you!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.320
Gorgonic Guardian attacks you directly!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.460
Have another blow!

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.670
GO!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:44.900
Now you and your entire army are about finished off!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.360
Not yet!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:50.070
Huh~?

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:57.830
Even if my body is destroyed, my soul given by the Gods shall revive!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.670
My turn! Draw!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.130
I activate the effect of the Geyser Shark from my Graveyard!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:10.970
When this guy's in my Graveyard, he can be used as Xyz Material!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.930
I'll Overlay my two Level Five Geyser Sharks!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.230
Absurd! An Xyz Summon from the Graveyard?!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.650
I'll use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.570
Xyz Summon!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.780
Show yourself, Number 73!

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.990
The God descends!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.530
Abyss Splash the Roaring Waterfall Deity!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.210
You called God in this situation!?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.630
I activate Abyss Splash's effect!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:49.010
By detaching one Overlay Unit, his Attack Power doubles during battle!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.260
Go! Abyss Splash!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.600
I activate Gorgonic Guardian's effect!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.850
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:05.810
the effects of one Monster on the field is negated and its Attack Points drop to zero!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.400
You won't get away!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.360
Trap, activate! Overlay Wedge!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.280
When an Xyz Monster detaches its Overlay Units,

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:16.330
and its effect activates, its effect is negated!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:21.250
Then, all Xyz Monsters on the field this turn other than the one with the highest rank

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.790
can't detach Overlay Units to activate their effects!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.750
What?!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.250
You lose!

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.010
Vector!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.340
Go, Abyss Splash!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.510
Attack Gorgonic Guardian!

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.970
Final Fall!!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:45.940
But the fate you bear will be <i>burned forever</i> in your eyes!

00:16:58.410 --> 00:16:59.240
Vector...

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.200
Is it over?

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:13.470
This is...

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.320
Iris...! Iris!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.660
I couldn't...

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.920
...protect you from this...!

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.920
No, that's not true!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:50.540
I...

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.590
..stole it from all of you!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:56.340
The lives of my soldiers, my comrades, and my friends!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.580
All of their souls went...to Barian World.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.000
Rio... Durbe...

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:32.880
That's right... I remember now.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.380
This is my true life.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.800
I also remembered.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.680
My true memories...

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.390
I understand now.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:45.220
So that's why you were reborn as the leader of the Barians.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.270
The Barian World was originally very small,

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:52.440
but due to all the souls involved in the battle between you and Vector,

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:53.610
it grew in size.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:58.280
I...went to the Barian World?

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.200
Ryouga...

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.450
I'm...a Barian!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.870
Can such an ironic fate exist?!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:13.290
Yuma... Astral... Kaito...

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.960
The true enemy they've been fighting against...

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.220
For me to be one of them...!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:26.010
That's right... This Duel...

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:29.480
...is one I positively... absolutely... can't lose!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:35.270
The deck me and Astral made together should give me an answer no matter what!

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.650
It's my turn! Draw!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.570
The energy levels are skyrocketing!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.410
What's wrong?

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:44.370
Just what's going on!?

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:49.330
A large amount of energy that we ill equipped to measure is being released somewhere in a different universe.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.580
Eh!? Do you mean Yuma's behind it?

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:52.790
This isn't good...

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:56.500
I don't know how long this machine will last like this...

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.710
That's...

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.970
I activate the Magic Card, Xyz Treasure!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:10.480
This card lets me draw a card from my deck for each Xyz Monster on the field!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.730
So, I get to draw two cards!

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:19.860
<i>Astral... I'm gonna get you outta there no matter what.</i>

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.990
This is my Destiny Draw!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.870
I'm gonna bring it to ya!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.580
It's here!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:31.710
Hm?

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:35.210
I activate a Magic! Stealth Strike!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:43.680
This card lets me halve an Xyz Monster's Attack Power during this turn to allow it to attack directly!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.550
What!?

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.260
And since Monsters ain't battlin'...

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.640
the effect of Rank Domination doesn't activate!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.140
Your Life is 1200. This is the end!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:56.900
Hope Ray Victory, attack directly!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.190
This is an attack I cannot allow!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.450
Trap, activate! Rank Wall!

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:09.160
This card allows me to negate that attack and end the Battle Phase when

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:16.210
when I control an Xyz Monster with a Rank higher than the Rank of the attacking Monster!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.050
What?!

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.260
That attack didn't work either...

